abstract: >
  praatMEX provides a MATLAB MEX interface to the Praat phonetics library,
  enabling in-process execution of 11 speech analysis algorithms (pitch, formant,
  intensity, harmonicity/HNR, jitter, shimmer, MFCC, spectrum, CPP/CPPS,
  point process, TextGrid) with 100-500x speedup over the traditional
  Praat.exe subprocess approach. Works in compiled MATLAB applications.